% 1. \href has optional arguments: \href[options]{url}{text}
% 2. hyperref heavily patches \href internally
% 3. Many packages (doi, url) wrap \href in complex ways
%
% For now, we leave \href unhooked. The hyperref package already provides
% some accessibility features for links. A proper implementation would need:
% - Use \LetLtxMacro to preserve optional argument handling
% - Hook at hyperref's internal level (e.g., \hyper@link)
% - Careful testing with all document classes
%
% TODO: Implement safe \href hooking in a future version.
